      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "两代插件接口并存",
      "items": [
        "v1：Register(*gin.RouterGroup)+RouterPath()，以邮件插件为代表",
        "v2：Register(*gin.Engine)，init() 自注册到全局注册表",
        "blank import server/plugin/register.go 触发 v2 插件 init"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "自举式元数据安装",
